        "order": 4,
        "type": "action",
        "text": {
          "es": "PG exterior La nave se desprende del muelle axial. Ya libre de Proxima, despliega velos oscuros de radiación térmica y orienta su tobera magnética hacia el arco de salida. Overlay: \"TRÁNSITO A LA BOCA: 57H 48MIN.\"",
          "en": "External PG The ship detaches from the axial spring. Now free of Proxima, it deploys dark veils of thermal radiation and directs its magnetic nozzle toward the exit arc. Overlay: \"TRANSIT TO THE MOUTH: 57H 48MIN.\""
        }
